{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["Not by your righteousness and the uprightness of your heart — for surely — זכור אל תשכח את אשר הקצפת וגו׳ — only one of two things is true: by their wickedness they forfeited their inheritance. And that you inherit it — not by your righteousness, but למען הקים את השבועה וגו׳."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {0 "The lemma quotes Deut 9:5; the unquoted continuation 'זכור אל תשכח' alludes to Deut 9:7; 'למען הקים את השבועה' alludes to Deut 9:5 itself. 'אפס אחד משני דברים אמת' rendered literally; the logic appears to be: both Israel's disinheritance of the nations and Israel's own inheritance are not on account of Israel's merit."}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:38:34.488864124Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}